    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_text">RE*start is a free, open-source launcher. The source code, the changelog and the list of changes since the fork are on GitHub; the project\'s home is remaker.ch.</string>
    <string name="feedback_title">Feedback</string>
    <string name="feedback_text">Found a bug or have an idea? Say what you did, what happened and what you expected, and add the RE*start and Android versions; the RE* mark at the bottom of the settings shows a device summary you can screenshot or copy. Send it as a GitHub issue or by e-mail.</string>
