    <string name="credits_lineage">RE*start is built on Multi Launcher (mLauncher): Olauncher (Tanuj M., 2020) → OlauncherCF (Joscha Loos) → mLauncher (Wayne Wesley) → RE*start. GPL-3.0 at every step.</string>
    <string name="credits_thanks">Thank you</string>
